@page "/agents/payments"

<PageTitle>Payments Agent — Wealth Team in a Day</PageTitle>

<div class="agent-header" style="--accent: #a855f7">
    <a class="back-link" href="/"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to the operations office</a>
    <div class="agent-header-row">
        <div class="agent-header-icon">💳</div>
        <div>
            <div class="agent-header-dept">Payments</div>
            <h1>Payments Agent</h1>
            <div class="agent-header-persona">Penny — Payments Officer</div>
            <p class="tagline">Gets the tax right, then waits for the human approval.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="agent-tab-scope" style="--accent: #a855f7">
    <nav class="agent-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Payments agent details">
        <button type="button" class="agent-tab active" data-tab="overview" role="tab" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0">Overview</button>
        <button type="button" class="agent-tab" data-tab="try" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Try it out</button>
    </nav>

    <div class="agent-tab-panel active" data-panel="overview" role="tabpanel">
    <section class="panel" style="--accent: #a855f7">
        <h2>What this agent does</h2>
        <p>
            Releases money correctly — financial hardship lump sums, pension commencements and regular
            pension payments, death benefits and outbound rollovers — and invests incoming money on
            arrival. Penny's agent validates the payee, confirms the eligibility decision on the Member
            Case, splits the tax-free and taxable components, calculates PAYG withholding and the net
            payment, checks authority limits and raises a Microsoft Teams approval. Nothing is paid until
            a human approves.
        </p>
        <div class="two-col">
            <div>
                <h3>Responsibilities</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Validate the payee and bank details against the member or the nominated beneficiaries on file.</li>
                    <li>Confirm the eligibility decision and approved amount from Benefits &amp; Eligibility.</li>
                    <li>Split tax-free and taxable components; calculate PAYG withholding and the net payment.</li>
                    <li>Check authority limits and raise a Microsoft Teams approval card.</li>
                    <li>Release only after approval — and confirm no funds leave a blocked account.</li>
                    <li>Invest incoming rollovers on arrival, keeping 1% in the Caldova Cash Account.</li>
                    <li>Draft the payment confirmation for Client Communications to send.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3>Tools available</h3>
                <ul class="payments-tool-list">
                    <li><code>payments_validatePayee</code> — payee and bank details match the member or beneficiary</li>
                    <li><code>payments_checkCaseApproval</code> — eligibility decision and approved amount</li>
                    <li><code>payments_calculateBenefit</code> — components, PAYG withholding and net payment</li>
                    <li><code>payments_checkAuthorityLimit</code> — when the Team Leader must approve</li>
                    <li><code>payments_requestApproval</code> — raises the approval and posts the Teams card</li>
                    <li><code>payments_getApprovalStatus</code> — pending, approved, rejected, released or blocked</li>
                    <li><code>payments_releasePayment</code> — gated release; refuses unless approved</li>
                    <li><code>teams_sendApprovalCard</code> — Microsoft Teams Adaptive Card <span class="muted">(called by payments_requestApproval)</span></li>
                    <li>Azure AI Search — tax, hardship, pension and death benefit rules <span class="muted">(cited by title)</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="payments-overview-h3">Human approval</h3>
        <div class="approval">
            <p>The Team Leader (Theo) must approve before money moves when there is:</p>
            <ul class="payments-rule-list">
                <li>any single payment of <strong>$250,000 or more</strong>;</li>
                <li><strong>any death benefit</strong>;</li>
                <li><strong>any financial hardship release</strong> (a vulnerable member);</li>
                <li>a <strong>pension commencement of $1,000,000 or more</strong>;</li>
                <li>any <strong>blocked case</strong> or a <strong>payee that doesn't match</strong> the member or a nominated beneficiary.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Every other release still needs Penny's sign-off — the agent never releases money on its own.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="--accent: #a855f7">
        <h2>Automated payment flow with human approval in Microsoft Teams</h2>
        <div class="demo">
            <p>
                The Payments Agent is wired to a dedicated MCP tool surface served by this app
                (<code>caldova-ops-mcp</code>), so each step of the payment workflow is a discrete,
                auditable tool call: <code>payments_validatePayee</code>,
                <code>payments_checkCaseApproval</code>, <code>payments_calculateBenefit</code>,
                <code>payments_checkAuthorityLimit</code>, <code>payments_requestApproval</code>,
                <code>payments_getApprovalStatus</code> and <code>payments_releasePayment</code>.
                Every call — with its inputs and results — appears in the agent's raw output, so the
                audit trail shows exactly what was checked and why.
            </p>
            <p>
                When the cross-checks are complete, the agent calls <code>payments_requestApproval</code>,
                which mints an approval id and invokes <code>teams_sendApprovalCard</code> to post the
                <strong>"Caldova Wealth — Payment approval"</strong> Adaptive Card to the approvals channel.
                The card shows the case number, member, payment type, gross amount, tax withheld, net
                payment, the payee with masked bank details and why approval is needed, with
                <strong>Approve</strong> and <strong>Reject</strong> actions. The agent then stops and waits.
            </p>
            <p>
                Once the approver says yes — in Teams, or on this page in the demo — the same agent
                conversation resumes and calls <code>payments_releasePayment</code>. That tool refuses to run
                while the approval is pending, rejected or blocked, so money can't leave without a human
                decision.
            </p>
            <ol class="payments-flow">
                <li><span>1</span>Validate payee</li>
                <li><span>2</span>Confirm case approval</li>
                <li><span>3</span>Components &amp; PAYG withholding</li>
                <li><span>4</span>Authority check</li>
                <li><span>5</span>Teams approval card</li>
                <li><span>6</span>Release after approval</li>
                <li><span>7</span>Payment confirmation</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="--accent: #a855f7">
        <h2>How Penny's agent helps on each case</h2>
        <div class="payments-cases-table-wrap">
            <table class="payments-cases-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>Case</th><th>What the Payments Agent does</th><th>Human approval</th></tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Tom Bradley</strong><br /><span class="muted">Financial hardship</span></td>
                        <td>$10,000 gross (partial — $15,000 was requested): $600 tax-free, $9,400 taxable, $2,068 withheld at 22% — <strong>$7,932</strong> paid on Fri 13/11/2026, $2,068 remitted to the ATO.</td>
                        <td>Team Leader — hardship release</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Robert &amp; Lily Chen</strong><br /><span class="muted">Death benefit</span></td>
                        <td>$243,100 each under Mei's binding nomination: $92,378 tax-free, $150,722 taxable, $25,622.74 withheld at 17% — <strong>$217,477.26</strong> paid to each.</td>
                        <td>Team Leader — every death benefit</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>George Papadopoulos</strong><br /><span class="muted">Retirement pension</span></td>
                        <td>$1,250,000 into pension CP-3077881 on 16/11/2026; <strong>$6,500 a month</strong> from 15/12/2026 to the joint account, no tax withheld (age 66).</td>
                        <td>Team Leader — commencement of $1,000,000 or more</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Grace Williams</strong><br /><span class="muted">Rollover blocked</span></td>
                        <td>No payment released: the payee "G Williams Holdings Pty Ltd" doesn't match and Financial Crime has blocked the case — <strong>$612,400 stays invested</strong>.</td>
                        <td>Block approved by the Team Leader; release disabled</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td><strong>Priya Natarajan</strong><br /><span class="muted">New account</span></td>
                        <td>Invest on arrival: the Harbourline rollover (about $41,800) goes into the Growth model, keeping 1% in cash; $275 a month adviser fee under her signed consent.</td>
                        <td>None — no money leaves Caldova</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </section>
    </div>

    <div class="agent-tab-panel" data-panel="try" role="tabpanel">
    <section class="panel payments-panel" style="--accent: #a855f7">
        <h2>Try it out — Payments demo</h2>
        <p class="muted payments-help">
            Walk through how Penny's Payments Agent picks up a Member Case, confirms the payment inputs,
            works out the tax-free and taxable components, PAYG withholding and the net payment,
            cross-checks the payee, the eligibility decision and authority limits, and raises a
            Microsoft Teams approval — money is released only after a human approves. Every step runs
            live against the <code>/payments/*</code> endpoints in this app.
        </p>

        <div id="payments-deeplink" class="payments-deeplink" hidden></div>

        <!-- Step 1 — pick a case -->
        <div class="payments-step" data-step="1">
            <div class="payments-step-head">
                <span class="payments-step-num">1</span>
                <h3>Pick a case</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="muted">
                Choose a Member Case. The five scenario cases are pre-loaded; cases opened in the
                <a href="/agents/onboarding">Onboarding</a> demo appear here too.
            </p>
            <div class="payments-case-picker">
                <select id="payments-case-select" class="payments-select" aria-label="Member Case">
                    <option value="">— Loading cases —</option>
                </select>
                <button id="payments-refresh-btn" type="button" class="payments-refresh" title="Reload cases">↻</button>
            </div>
            <div id="payments-case-empty" class="payments-status" hidden>
                No cases in memory yet. Run the <a href="/agents/onboarding">Onboarding</a> demo first to open a case.
            </div>
            <div id="payments-case-summary" class="payments-summary" hidden>
                <div class="payments-summary-grid">
                    <div><span class="k">Case</span><span id="payments-case-num"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Member</span><span id="payments-case-member"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Product</span><span id="payments-case-product"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Request</span><span id="payments-case-type"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Received</span><span id="payments-case-received"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Adviser</span><span id="payments-case-adviser"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Amount</span><span id="payments-case-amount"></span></div>
                    <div><span class="k">Priority</span><span id="payments-case-priority"></span></div>
                    <div class="span-2"><span class="k">Summary</span><span id="payments-case-summary-text"></span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 — payment inputs -->
        <div class="payments-step" data-step="2" id="payments-inputs-step" hidden>
            <div class="payments-step-head">
                <span class="payments-step-num">2</span>
                <h3>Confirm payment inputs</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="muted">
                Defaults come from the case and the Benefits &amp; Eligibility decision. Edit any value —
                the calculation, cross-checks and approval follow your inputs. Bank details stay masked.
            </p>
            <div id="payments-inputs-hint" class="payments-hint" hidden></div>
            <form id="payments-inputs-form" class="payments-form" autocomplete="off">
                <fieldset>
                    <legend>Payment</legend>
                    <div class="payments-grid">
                        <label>Payment type<select name="paymentType"></select></label>
                        <label>Gross amount (AUD)<input type="number" name="grossAmount" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
                        <label data-field="requested">Amount requested (AUD)<input type="number" name="requestedAmount" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
                        <label data-field="commencement">Pension commencement amount (AUD)<input type="number" name="commencementAmount" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
                        <label class="span-2">Payment date<input type="text" name="paymentDate" /></label>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                <fieldset>
                    <legend>Tax</legend>
                    <div class="payments-grid">
                        <label data-field="tax">Tax-free component (%)<input type="number" name="taxFreePercent" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" /></label>
                        <label>Member age<input type="number" name="memberAge" min="0" max="120" step="1" /></label>
                        <label class="span-2">Tax status<select name="taxStatus"></select></label>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>
                <fieldset id="payments-payees-fieldset">
                    <legend>Payee(s) — bank details masked</legend>
                    <div class="payments-payee-head" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span>Name on the account</span><span>BSB</span><span>Account</span><span>Share %</span>
                    </div>
                    <div id="payments-payee-rows"></div>
                    <div id="payments-payees-onfile" class="payments-onfile"></div>
                </fieldset>
                <div id="payments-no-payee" class="payments-no-payee" hidden>
                    No outbound payee — the money is coming into the member's own Caldova account.
                </div>
                <fieldset>
                    <legend>Case approval — from Benefits &amp; Eligibility</legend>
                    <div class="payments-grid">
                        <label>Decision<select name="caseApprovalStatus"></select></label>
                        <label>Approved amount (AUD)<input type="number" name="approvedAmount" min="0" step="0.01" /></label>
                    </div>
                    <div id="payments-case-decision" class="payments-decision"></div>
                </fieldset>
            </form>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 — engage the agent -->
        <div class="payments-step" data-step="3" id="payments-process-step" hidden>
            <div class="payments-step-head">
                <span class="payments-step-num">3</span>
                <h3>Engage the Payments Agent</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="muted">
                Penny's agent runs the payments_* MCP tools — validate the payee, check the case approval,
                calculate the benefit, check the authority limit and request approval — streams its
                narrative and posts the Microsoft Teams approval card. Release unlocks only after approval.
            </p>
            <button id="payments-process-btn" type="button">Process with Payments Agent</button>
            <div id="payments-process-status" class="payments-status" hidden></div>

            <div class="engage-tabs-scope" data-engage-role="payments">
                <div class="engage-tabs" role="tablist">
                    <button type="button" class="engage-tab-btn active" data-engage-tab="narrative">Agent Narrative</button>
                    <button type="button" class="engage-tab-btn" data-engage-tab="reference">Reference</button>
                    <button type="button" class="engage-tab-btn" data-engage-tab="prompt">Agent Prompt &amp; Tools</button>
                    <button type="button" class="engage-tab-btn" data-engage-tab="input">Agent Input</button>
                    <button type="button" class="engage-tab-btn" data-engage-tab="output">Raw Output</button>
                </div>

                <div class="engage-tab-panel active" data-engage-tab="narrative">
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>Agent narrative (streamed)</h4>
                        <div class="agent-md engage-narrative-body"><div class="engage-empty">Engage the agent to see the streamed narrative.</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="engage-tab-panel" data-engage-tab="reference">
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>Reference documents cited by the agent</h4>
                        <div class="engage-references-body"><div class="engage-empty">Engage the agent to see the reference documents cited in its response.</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="engage-tab-panel" data-engage-tab="prompt">
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>Agent metadata</h4>
                        <div class="engage-info-meta engage-meta"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>System prompt</h4>
                        <pre class="engage-pre engage-prompt-body">Loading…</pre>
                    </div>
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>Tools available</h4>
                        <ul class="engage-tools-list"><li class="engage-empty">Loading…</li></ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="engage-tab-panel" data-engage-tab="input">
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>Prompt sent to the agent</h4>
                        <pre class="engage-pre engage-input-body engage-empty">Engage the agent to capture the input that was sent.</pre>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="engage-tab-panel" data-engage-tab="output">
                    <div class="engage-info-block">
                        <h4>Raw agent output (text, citations and every output item, including the payments_* MCP tool calls)</h4>
                        <div class="json-viewer engage-output-body"><div class="engage-empty">Engage the agent to see the full raw response.</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="payments-result" class="payments-result" hidden>
                <div class="payments-card payments-calc">
                    <div class="payments-card-label" id="payments-calc-title">Payment calculation</div>
                    <div class="payments-calc-scroll">
                        <table class="payments-calc-table">
                            <thead id="payments-calc-head"></thead>
                            <tbody id="payments-calc-body"></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payments-net" id="payments-net">
                        <span class="k" id="payments-net-label">Net payment</span>
                        <span id="payments-net-amount"></span>
                    </div>
                    <dl class="payments-context" id="payments-context"></dl>
                    <div class="payments-rule" id="payments-calc-rule"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="payments-card">
                    <div class="payments-card-label">Cross-checks</div>
                    <ul id="payments-checks-list" class="payments-checks-list"></ul>
                </div>

                <div class="payments-callout payments-approval" id="payments-approval">
                    <div class="payments-callout-head">
                        <span class="payments-step-num small">!</span>
                        <span class="payments-callout-title">Human approval</span>
                        <span class="payments-pill" id="payments-approval-pill"></span>
                    </div>
                    <ul id="payments-approval-reasons" class="payments-reasons"></ul>
                    <p class="payments-approver" id="payments-approval-approver"></p>
                </div>

                <!-- Outbound payment: Microsoft Teams approval, then release -->
                <div class="payments-callout payments-teams" id="payments-teams" hidden>
                    <div class="payments-callout-head">
                        <span class="payments-step-num small teams">T</span>
                        <span class="payments-callout-title">Microsoft Teams approval</span>
                        <span class="payments-pill" id="payments-teams-pill"></span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="payments-teams-msg" id="payments-teams-msg"></p>
                    <div class="payments-teams-preview" id="payments-teams-preview"></div>
                    <div class="payments-teams-meta">
                        <div><span class="k">Approval id</span> <code id="payments-teams-approvalid"></code></div>
                        <div><span class="k">Approval link</span> <a id="payments-teams-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open</a></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payments-actions">
                        <button type="button" id="payments-popup-btn" class="payments-popup">Open approval popup</button>
                        <button type="button" id="payments-release-btn" class="payments-release" disabled>Release payment</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payments-release-hint" id="payments-release-hint">Release unlocks once the approval is recorded.</div>
                    <div class="payments-teams-status" id="payments-teams-status" hidden></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Blocked case: nothing can be released -->
                <div class="payments-callout payments-blocked" id="payments-blocked" hidden>
                    <div class="payments-callout-head">
                        <span class="payments-step-num small blocked">✕</span>
                        <span class="payments-callout-title">Release blocked — no funds leave the account</span>
                        <span class="payments-pill status-blocked">Blocked</span>
                    </div>
                    <p id="payments-blocked-text"></p>
                    <p class="payments-blocked-record" id="payments-blocked-record"></p>
                    <div class="payments-actions">
                        <button type="button" id="payments-blocked-release" class="payments-release" disabled>Release payment</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payments-release-hint" id="payments-blocked-hint"></div>
                </div>

                <!-- Inbound money: invest on arrival, nothing to release -->
                <div class="payments-callout payments-inbound" id="payments-inbound" hidden>
                    <div class="payments-callout-head">
                        <span class="payments-step-num small inbound">↓</span>
                        <span class="payments-callout-title">No outbound payment — invest on arrival</span>
                        <span class="payments-pill optional">No approval needed</span>
                    </div>
                    <p id="payments-inbound-text"></p>
                </div>

                <div class="payments-card payments-notes">
                    <div class="payments-card-label" id="payments-confirmation-title">Payment confirmation draft</div>
                    <div id="payments-confirmation" class="agent-md"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </section>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Approval popup: the in-page stand-in for the Approve / Reject
     actions on the Microsoft Teams card. Approving resumes the same
     Payments Agent conversation so it can call payments_releasePayment. -->
<div id="payments-approval-modal" class="payments-modal" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="payments-modal-title">
    <div class="payments-modal-backdrop" data-modal-dismiss></div>
    <div class="payments-modal-card" role="document">
        <button type="button" class="payments-modal-close" data-modal-dismiss aria-label="Close">×</button>
        <div class="payments-modal-header">
            <span class="payments-modal-badge">!</span>
            <div>
                <h3 id="payments-modal-title">Payment approval required</h3>
                <div class="payments-modal-sub">Caldova Wealth — Payment approval · Microsoft Teams</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="payments-modal-deeplink" id="payments-modal-deeplink" hidden></div>
        <div class="payments-modal-why">Why approval is needed</div>
        <ul class="payments-modal-reasons" id="payments-modal-reasons"></ul>
        <div class="payments-modal-meta">
            <div><span class="k">Case</span><span id="payments-modal-case"></span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Approval id</span><code id="payments-modal-approval-id"></code></div>
            <div class="span-2"><span class="k">Member</span><span id="payments-modal-member"></span></div>
            <div class="span-2"><span class="k">Payment type</span><span id="payments-modal-type"></span></div>
            <div class="span-2"><span class="k">Payee</span><span id="payments-modal-payee"></span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Gross</span><span id="payments-modal-gross"></span></div>
            <div><span class="k">Tax withheld</span><span id="payments-modal-tax"></span></div>
            <div class="span-2 amount-row"><span class="k">Net payment</span><strong id="payments-modal-net"></strong></div>
        </div>
        <p class="payments-modal-explainer">
            Approving here stands in for the approver pressing <strong>Approve</strong> on the Teams card.
            It resumes the same Payments Agent conversation so Penny can call
            <code>payments_releasePayment</code> — the tool refuses to run until the approval is recorded.
        </p>
        <div class="payments-modal-status" id="payments-modal-status" hidden></div>
        <div class="payments-modal-agent" id="payments-modal-agent" hidden>
            <div class="payments-modal-agent-label">Agent reply after approval</div>
            <div class="agent-md" id="payments-modal-agent-body"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="payments-modal-actions">
            <button type="button" id="payments-modal-reject-btn" class="payments-modal-reject">Reject</button>
            <button type="button" id="payments-modal-cancel-btn" class="payments-modal-cancel" data-modal-dismiss>Close</button>
            <button type="button" id="payments-modal-approve-btn" class="payments-modal-approve">Approve</button>
            <button type="button" id="payments-modal-release-btn" class="payments-modal-release" disabled>Release payment</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .payments-panel, .payments-modal { --pay-accent: #a855f7; --pay-teams: #5b5fc7; }
    .payments-panel [hidden], .payments-modal[hidden], .payments-modal [hidden] { display: none !important; }
    .payments-help { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
    .payments-help code, .payments-panel .muted code { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.14); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; }

    /* ── Overview ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .payments-tool-list code, .payments-flow code { font-size: 0.82rem; background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.14); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .payments-overview-h3 { margin-top: 1.1rem !important; }
    .approval p { margin: 0.2rem 0; }
    .payments-rule-list { margin: 0.35rem 0 0.45rem 0 !important; }
    .payments-flow {
        list-style: none; margin: 0.9rem 0 0 0; padding: 0;
        display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem;
    }
    .payments-flow li {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.45rem;
        background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.7);
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, #a855f7 35%, rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.2));
        border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.75rem 0.3rem 0.35rem;
        font-size: 0.82rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.9);
    }
    .payments-flow li span {
        display: inline-grid; place-items: center;
        width: 1.35rem; height: 1.35rem; border-radius: 50%;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, #a855f7 25%, rgba(20, 28, 46, 0.8));
        color: #e9d5ff; font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .payments-cases-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; }
    .payments-cases-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88); }
    .payments-cases-table th {
        text-align: left; font-size: 0.66rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.22);
    }
    .payments-cases-table td { padding: 0.6rem; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.16); vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.45; }
    .payments-cases-table td:first-child { min-width: 9.5rem; }
    .payments-cases-table td:last-child { min-width: 11rem; color: #e9d5ff; }

    /* ── Steps ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .payments-step {
        border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.18);
        background: rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.4);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 0.95rem 1.1rem 1rem 1.1rem;
        margin-top: 0.9rem;
    }
    .payments-step-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
    .payments-step-head h3 { margin: 0; color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; }
    .payments-step-num {
        display: inline-grid; place-items: center; flex: 0 0 auto;
        width: 1.55rem; height: 1.55rem; border-radius: 50%;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 22%, rgba(20, 28, 46, 0.7));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 55%, transparent);
        color: var(--pay-accent); font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700;
    }
    .payments-step-num.small { width: 1.4rem; height: 1.4rem; font-size: 0.7rem; }
    .payments-step-num.teams { background: rgba(91, 95, 199, 0.3); border-color: rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.7); color: #c7d2fe; }
    .payments-step-num.blocked { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6); color: #fca5a5; }
    .payments-step-num.inbound { background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.2); border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.6); color: #7dd3fc; }
    .payments-step .muted { color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0.35rem 0 0.7rem 0; }

    .payments-deeplink {
        margin: 0.3rem 0 0.4rem 0; padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem;
        background: rgba(91, 95, 199, 0.16); border: 1px solid rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.45); color: #e0e7ff;
    }
    .payments-deeplink.error { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12); border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); color: #fecaca; }

    .payments-case-picker { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }
    .payments-select, .payments-form select, .payments-form input, .payments-payee-row input {
        background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.7);
        border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.22);
        border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem; font-family: inherit;
    }
    .payments-select { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .payments-select:focus, .payments-form select:focus, .payments-form input:focus, .payments-payee-row input:focus {
        outline: none; border-color: var(--pay-accent);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 25%, transparent);
    }
    .payments-refresh {
        background: transparent; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.86);
        border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.32); border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 0.45rem 0.7rem; font-size: 0.95rem; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .payments-refresh:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: #fff; }

    .payments-summary {
        margin-top: 0.7rem; background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.7);
        border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.18); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    }
    .payments-summary-grid {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88);
    }
    .payments-summary-grid .span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
    .payments-summary-grid .k {
        display: inline-block; min-width: 76px; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.66rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-right: 0.5rem;
    }

    /* ── Inputs ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .payments-hint {
        margin: 0 0 0.7rem 0; padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.86rem; line-height: 1.45;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 10%, rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.7));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 30%, transparent); color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.9);
    }
    .payments-form fieldset {
        border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.16); border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem 0.8rem 0.85rem; margin: 0 0 0.7rem 0;
    }
    .payments-form legend {
        float: none; width: auto; margin: 0; padding: 0 0.35rem;
        font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 700; color: #d8b4fe;
    }
    .payments-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.6rem 0.85rem; }
    .payments-grid .span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
    .payments-form label {
        display: block; font-size: 0.68rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); font-weight: 700;
    }
    .payments-form label input, .payments-form label select {
        display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.3rem; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: normal; font-weight: 400;
    }
    .payments-payee-head, .payments-payee-row {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.2fr 1fr 1.2fr 0.8fr; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center;
    }
    .payments-payee-head {
        font-size: 0.64rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); margin: 0.2rem 0 0.3rem 0;
    }
    .payments-payee-row { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .payments-payee-row input { width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
    .payments-onfile { margin-top: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); line-height: 1.7; }
    .payments-onfile-chip {
        display: inline-block; margin: 0 0.3rem 0.2rem 0; padding: 0.1rem 0.55rem; border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.75); border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.22); color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88);
    }
    .payments-onfile-chip em { font-style: normal; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); margin-left: 0.35rem; }
    .payments-no-payee {
        margin: 0 0 0.7rem 0; padding: 0.55rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.86rem;
        background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.3); color: #bae6fd;
    }
    .payments-decision { margin-top: 0.55rem; font-size: 0.84rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.86); }
    .payments-decision .muted { display: block; font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

    /* ── Engage ───────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    #payments-process-btn {
        background: var(--pay-accent); color: #1a0633; border: none; border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 0.55rem 1.1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }
    #payments-process-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.55; cursor: not-allowed; }
    #payments-process-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { filter: brightness(1.08); }
    .payments-status { margin-top: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88); }
    .payments-status.error { color: #fca5a5; }
    .payments-status.warn { color: #fcd34d; }
    .payments-panel .spinner, .payments-modal .spinner {
        display: inline-block; width: 12px; height: 12px;
        border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); border-top-color: #fff;
        border-radius: 50%; margin-right: 6px; vertical-align: middle;
        animation: payments-spin 0.7s linear infinite;
    }
    @@keyframes payments-spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

    /* ── Results ──────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .payments-result { margin-top: 0.85rem; display: grid; gap: 0.85rem; }
    .payments-card {
        background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.7); border: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.18);
        border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
    }
    .payments-card-label {
        font-size: 0.66rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .payments-calc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
    .payments-calc-table {
        width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.88rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.9);
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    }
    .payments-calc-table th {
        text-align: left; font-family: inherit; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #d8b4fe; font-weight: 700;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.2rem 0.4rem 0.2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.22);
    }
    .payments-calc-table th.amount, .payments-calc-table td.amount { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; padding-left: 1rem; }
    .payments-calc-table td { padding: 0.32rem 0.2rem; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(120, 150, 200, 0.18); }
    .payments-calc-table td.neg { color: #fca5a5; }
    .payments-calc-table td.pos { color: #86efac; }
    .payments-calc-table tr.kind-component td:first-child { padding-left: 1rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.78); }
    .payments-calc-table tr.kind-total td { border-bottom: none; padding-top: 0.55rem; font-weight: 700; }

    .payments-net {
        margin-top: 0.6rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
        padding: 0.55rem 0.85rem; border-radius: 8px;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 14%, rgba(20, 28, 46, 0.7));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 45%, transparent);
    }
    .payments-net.mode-protected { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1); border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); }
    .payments-net.mode-inbound { background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.1); border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.4); }
    .payments-net .k { color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.86); font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-weight: 700; }
    #payments-net-amount {
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
        font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-align: right;
    }
    .payments-context { margin: 0.7rem 0 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.4rem 1rem; }
    .payments-context div { min-width: 0; }
    .payments-context dt { font-size: 0.64rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); font-weight: 700; }
    .payments-context dd { margin: 0.1rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.9); line-height: 1.4; }
    .payments-rule { margin-top: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); }

    .payments-checks-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .payments-check { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; align-items: flex-start; }
    .payments-check-icon {
        flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 1.45rem; height: 1.45rem; border-radius: 50%;
        font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; margin-top: 0.05rem;
    }
    .payments-check.status-pass .payments-check-icon { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.18); color: #86efac; border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.45); }
    .payments-check.status-fail .payments-check-icon { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18); color: #fca5a5; border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.45); }
    .payments-check.status-warn .payments-check-icon { background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18); color: #fcd34d; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45); }
    .payments-check.status-na .payments-check-icon { background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16); color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4); }
    .payments-check-body { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
    .payments-check-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem 0.7rem; align-items: baseline; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .payments-check-value { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e9d5ff; }
    .payments-check.status-fail .payments-check-value { color: #fca5a5; }
    .payments-check.status-pass .payments-check-value { color: #86efac; }
    .payments-check.status-warn .payments-check-value { color: #fcd34d; }
    .payments-check-detail { font-size: 0.84rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.84); line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 0.15rem; }
    .payments-check-source { font-size: 0.74rem; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); margin-top: 0.15rem; }

    .payments-callout {
        border-radius: 10px; padding: 0.75rem 0.95rem;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 8%, rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.7));
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--pay-accent) 30%, transparent);
    }
    .payments-callout p { margin: 0.25rem 0 0 0; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88); font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.45; }
    .payments-callout-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.55rem; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .payments-callout-title { color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .payments-reasons { margin: 0.2rem 0 0 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88); font-size: 0.87rem; line-height: 1.5; }
    .payments-approver { font-size: 0.82rem !important; color: #d8b4fe !important; }
    .payments-pill {
        margin-left: auto; padding: 0.15rem 0.7rem; border-radius: 999px;
        font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18); color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4);
    }
    .payments-pill.required { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18); color: #fca5a5; border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); }
    .payments-pill.standard { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.18); color: #e9d5ff; border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.45); }
    .payments-pill.optional { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.16); color: #86efac; border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); }
    .payments-pill.status-pending { background: rgba(91, 95, 199, 0.22); color: #c7d2fe; border-color: rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.5); }
    .payments-pill.status-approved { background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.18); color: #86efac; border-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4); }
    .payments-pill.status-rejected, .payments-pill.status-blocked { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.18); color: #fca5a5; border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); }
    .payments-pill.status-released { background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); color: #e9d5ff; border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.5); }
    .payments-pill.status-cancelled { background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.16); color: #cbd5e1; }

    .payments-teams { background: color-mix(in srgb, #5b5fc7 10%, rgba(15, 22, 38, 0.75)); border-color: rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.4); }
    .payments-blocked { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.07); border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35); }
    .payments-inbound { background: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.07); border-color: rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.35); }
    .payments-blocked-record { font-size: 0.8rem !important; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6) !important; }
    .payments-teams-msg code { background: rgba(91, 95, 199, 0.25); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    .payments-teams-meta {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.3rem 0.85rem; margin: 0.6rem 0 0.2rem 0;
        font-size: 0.82rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.86);
    }
    .payments-teams-meta .k { color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.64rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-right: 0.35rem; }
    .payments-teams-meta code { background: rgba(10, 16, 28, 0.6); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .payments-teams-meta a { color: #c7d2fe; word-break: break-all; }
    .payments-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0.6rem; }
    .payments-actions button {
        border: none; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.45rem 0.95rem; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .payments-actions button:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: not-allowed; }
    .payments-popup { background: rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.25); color: #e0e7ff; border: 1px solid rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.5) !important; }
    .payments-release { background: #34d399; color: #052e1f; }
    .payments-release-hint { margin-top: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--cw-muted, #97a3b6); }
    .payments-teams-status { margin-top: 0.45rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.88); }
    .payments-teams-status.error { color: #fca5a5; }

    /* Microsoft Teams channel post + Adaptive Card preview */
    .payments-teams-preview { margin-top: 0.6rem; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.35); background: #1f1f2b; }
    .tp-channel-head {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.78rem;
        background: #2b2b40; color: #d6d8ff; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(129, 133, 230, 0.25);
    }
    .tp-logo { display: inline-grid; place-items: center; width: 1.2rem; height: 1.2rem; border-radius: 4px; background: #5b5fc7; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.7rem; }
    .tp-time { margin-left: auto; color: #a5a8d6; }
    .tp-post { display: flex; gap: 0.65rem; padding: 0.75rem; }
    .tp-avatar {
        flex: 0 0 auto; width: 2rem; height: 2rem; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #6d28d9); color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .tp-post-body { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
    .tp-author { font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f1ff; margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
    .tp-app { font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; background: #3b3b58; color: #c7c9f5; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem; margin-left: 0.3rem; }
    .tp-card { background: #292938; border: 1px solid #3d3d55; border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem; color: #ececf7; }
    .tp-card-title { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; }
    .tp-card-sub { font-size: 0.76rem; color: #a5a8d6; margin-bottom: 0.55rem; }
    .tp-facts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 0.25rem 0.9rem; margin: 0 0 0.6rem 0; font-size: 0.84rem; }
    .tp-facts dt { font-weight: 700; color: #f1f1ff; }
    .tp-facts dd { margin: 0; color: #dcdcf0; min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .tp-why-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.84rem; color: #fff; }
    .tp-why { margin: 0.2rem 0 0.45rem 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; font-size: 0.84rem; color: #dcdcf0; }
    .tp-note { font-size: 0.74rem; color: #a5a8d6; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
    .tp-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.45rem; }
    .tp-btn {
        border: 1px solid #5b5fc7; background: transparent; color: #c7d2fe; border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
